---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services - Raje Airey"
  description="Psychotherapy and counselling services for adults and young people in Stroud, Gloucestershire."
>
  <section class="services-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="/images/service-counselling.jpg" alt="Artwork representing therapy" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Services</h1>
        <p>
          I believe that diversity leads to a more inclusive and sustainable society.
          I work with people from all walks of life and abilities and welcome them to my practice,
          irrespective of class, race and ethnicity, faith, gender, relationship style or sexual orientation.
        </p>
        <div class="quote-block">
          <svg class="quote-icon" viewBox="0 0 50 40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M10 20c-5.5 0-10 4.5-10 10s4.5 10 10 10c5.5 0 10-4.5 10-10 0-15-10-30-20-30v8c5 0 10 7 10 12z" fill="currentColor"/>
            <path d="M40 20c-5.5 0-10 4.5-10 10s4.5 10 10 10c5.5 0 10-4.5 10-10 0-15-10-30-20-30v8c5 0 10 7 10 12z" fill="currentColor"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="quote-text">
            Raje was really considerate and aware of social climate and how my ethnicity influenced my mental health.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" id="counselling">
    <h2>Counselling</h2>
    <p>
      ...can be useful when usual support systems, such as family and friends, are not enough.
      For example after a bereavement, divorce, or a problem in the workplace, or if you are struggling
      with anxiety and want to find ways to manage it. My approach to counselling is time-limited
      (6-12 sessions) and solution-focused.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" id="psychotherapy">
    <h2>Psychotherapy</h2>
    <p>
      ...is a gradual process over time that allows for an in-depth exploration of more complex problems,
      many of which have their roots in the past. It aims to facilitate insight and understanding of yourself
      and relationships with significant others. It offers the potential for transformation, to find new ways
      of doing things rather than repeating the same old mistakes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" id="young-people">
    <h2>Young People (18+)</h2>
    <p>
      The transition from late teens into adult life can be challenging. There are many decisions to be made
      as you start to define who you are and what you want to do. Plus the rational 'thinking' brain is not
      fully online until about 25. Counselling offers young people a safe space to talk about things they
      may find too difficult or embarrassing to speak about with family or friends. Unless the problem is
      deep-seated, a few sessions are often enough to help you on your way.
    </p>
    <div class="quote-block small">
      <p class="quote-text">
        Working in a university counselling service, I see young people experiencing mental health problems
        with increasing frequency, severity and complexity. Often these started at school or in the family.
        Young people have also been particularly hard hit by Covid.
      </p>
      <p class="quote-author">Raje Airey</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-section" id="supervision">
    <h2>Supervision</h2>
    <p>
      I offer individual and group supervision to qualified counsellors and those in training.
      My therapeutic approach is integrative, combining humanistic and psychodynamic ways of working.
      I also supervise PCE-CfD trainees and practitioners.
    </p>
    <p>
      My aim is to create a supportive and safe learning environment that supports your personal and
      professional development. Together we will reflect on your client work and think about the therapy
      process, holding in mind ethical issues and dilemmas and looking out for potential blind spots.
      We will also focus on your wellbeing and the wellbeing and process of our supervisory relationship.
    </p>
    <blockquote>
      "Supervision is essential to how practitioners sustain good practice throughout their working life."
      <cite>Emma Mahoney</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="how-it-works">
    <h2>How does it work?</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">1.</span>
        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <p>Get in touch with any questions and/or to arrange a time for an initial discussion over Zoom or by phone. I offer in person and online appointments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">2.</span>
        <h3>Informal discussion</h3>
        <p>Opportunity for Q&A. We will talk about online working and where appropriate, arrange an assessment appointment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">3.</span>
        <h3>First appointment</h3>
        <p>Gathering detailed information to find out more about you and how we might work together. We will also go through my therapy agreement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">4.</span>
        <h3>On-going sessions</h3>
        <p>If we decide to work together we will arrange a regular weekly time for our sessions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fees-section">
    <h2>Fees</h2>
    <div class="fees-table">
      <div class="fee-row">
        <span class="fee-item">Informal discussion</span>
        <span class="fee-duration">Up to 20 minutes</span>
        <span class="fee-price">Free</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fee-row">
        <span class="fee-item">First appointment</span>
        <span class="fee-duration">60 minutes</span>
        <span class="fee-price">£65</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fee-row">
        <span class="fee-item">Ongoing appointments</span>
        <span class="fee-duration">50 minutes</span>
        <span class="fee-price">£60</span>
      </div>
      <div class="fee-row">
        <span class="fee-item">Supervision</span>
        <span class="fee-duration">60 minutes</span>
        <span class="fee-price">£60</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fee-note">
      I offer a limited number of reduced fee places for those facing financial hardship, or therapists in training. Please ask for details.
    </p>
    <p class="fee-note">
      Sessions are payable at the time of booking and must be cancelled or changed within 36 hours, otherwise, full payment is due.
    </p>
    <p class="fee-note">
      <strong>Payment Methods:</strong> Cash, Bank Transfer, PayPal.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="online-therapy">
    <h2>Online therapy</h2>
    <p>Working online is the new normal for many of us. There are advantages and disadvantages to online therapy.</p>
    <div class="pros-cons">
      <div class="pros">
        <h3>Advantages</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>No need to travel</li>
          <li>Takes less time</li>
          <li>Familiar surroundings can feel more secure</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cons">
        <h3>Disadvantages</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Some people feel less inhibited and take more risks</li>
          <li>You are responsible for the confidentiality of your end of the conversation</li>
          <li>We have to trust the technology</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-section">
    <h2>Privacy statement and data storage</h2>
    <p>
      I work under the terms of current data legislation, or General Data Protection Regulations (GDPR).
      The information from your enquiry will be stored on my password protected computer and smart phone.
      If we decide not to work together I will delete this information promptly.
    </p>
    <p>
      If we decide to work together you will be asked to complete a registration form after our initial
      discussion and prior to our first appointment. This contains your name, address, phone number,
      email address, date of birth, GP details and any other relevant personal information that you wish to share.
    </p>
    <p>
      In addition to your personal information I keep a session log and brief notes as a record of the work.
      Full information about data collection and storage is contained in my therapy contract.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">ENQUIRE</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .services-hero {
    padding: 50px 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-page);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .hero-content h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .quote-block {
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .quote-icon {
    color: #5a7a9a;
    width: 28px;
    height: 22px;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 10px;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .quote-block.small {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .quote-author {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .service-section {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px var(--spacing-page);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .service-section h2 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .service-section p {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  blockquote {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 20px 25px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
    margin: 25px 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  blockquote cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .how-it-works {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 50px var(--spacing-page);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .how-it-works h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .step {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .step h3 {
    color: #1a5276;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .step p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .fees-section {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 50px var(--spacing-page);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .fees-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .fees-table {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }

  .fee-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .fee-item {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .fee-duration {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .fee-price {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .fee-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 15px 0 0;
  }

  .online-therapy {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 50px var(--spacing-page);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .online-therapy h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .pros-cons {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .pros h3, .cons h3 {
    color: #1a5276;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy-section {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 50px var(--spacing-page);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .privacy-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px var(--spacing-page) 60px;
    border-top: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .pros-cons {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
